stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> OK : Upload ACK / Repair Copy / Unrecorded Valid Rejoin Adopted

    OK --> CORRUPT : Read checksum mismatch or 404/409
    OK --> CORRUPT : Scrub bit-rot or DB checksum mismatch
    OK --> CORRUPT : Rejoin inventory checksum mismatch
    OK --> PENDING_DELETE : Object DELETE started (logical delete)

    CORRUPT --> PENDING_DELETE : Replaced by repair when target worker was DEAD/unreachable
    CORRUPT --> OK : Worker rejoins with intact disk checksum matching DB
    CORRUPT --> [*] : Deleted on worker disk after repair replaces replica

    PENDING_DELETE --> [*] : Worker DELETE succeeds (during delete, repair, or rejoin reconciliation)
    OK --> [*] : Deleted on worker / trimmed over-replication / missing on disk at rejoin
